I was looking over this document when I realized I had addressed you as Ms.=
 rather than Captain. This did not sit right with me. I want to note I noti=
ced it and that no disrespect was intended. I've had little dealings with l=
aw enforcement in my lifetime and
 it just wasn't a convention that occurred to me when I sent this follow up=
. I hope that you can forgive the breach of decorum.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
