<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
Since I'm writing this, I'm going to do one other thing and say the plain t=
hings.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
Oregon State Police had no business getting involved in a first amendment m=
atter between myself and Oregon State Parks. It was completely unjustified =
and their own CAD document is the proof of that. I am now pursuing other do=
cuments from them that will further
 collapse the lie they placed there.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
I regret that the United States Forest Service has any involvement in this =
matter, but of course I had nothing to do with that, and now we see that Or=
egon State Police used you as both gatekeeper and shield. I understand that=
's real exposure and your job is
 to contain it. I have done my best to show the Forestry's real shape in th=
is, which from my perspective is a man turning a key in a lock he shouldn't=
 have. It is my hope that officer understands the gravity of what he did, b=
ut I require no further accountability
 from him.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
I ask only that you state for the record if you support the characterizatio=
n Oregon State Police have assigned to the United States Forest Service in =
this matter.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
