>
OSP's released CAD characterizes the March 24 visit as conducted &quot;for =
the Forest Service.&quot; Does USFS Law Enforcement support that characteri=
zation? Did USFS request or coordinate this visit? Please see my statement =
below.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-sys=
